// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL2.5_SG_KR_Mission_1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P500346356" "A villain from the Rogue Isles has shown up in Kings Row, intent on robbing the bank with an army of Skulls. We need heroes to <A HREF={ACCEPT}>go to Kings Row and protect the bank from that villain!</A> The robbers have probably made their way to the bank by now, so you should make your way there immediately. You probably have about 5 minutes or less before they make their escape.<br><br><color orange>This is a Safeguard mission. Once you prevent the heist, you will have 15 minutes to explore the area and potentially earn extra rewards before the P.P.D. lock down the area. You can earn extra time by defeating vandals and completing side missions, however you can lose time if they destroy too much of the city.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P263965379" "Protect Kings Row bank"
// SendOffString :
"P2547834071" "The villain has enlisted the help of the Skulls to do the job. They must be stopped as well. Other villains have heard about the heist, too, and are trying take advantage of the situation. Most notable, the Clockwork.<br><br><color orange>Periodically, vandals will arrive to destroy parts of the city. You will see a message when they arrive, and their locations will be displayed in your minimap.</color>"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2337330271" "Go protect Kings Row!"
// DeclineString :
"P737905035" "Sorry, can't help you this time."
// DeclineSendOffString :
"P3311727586" "What?! I understand, {HeroName}. You no doubt have some very important things to do. We'll do our best to stop them, but it doesn't look good."
// TaskTitle :
"P3419448001" "Safeguard Kings Row"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1576560371" "You run over to Kings Row as fast as you can. While the Skulls are trying to take out the bank vault, The Clockwork are taking advantage of the situation by taking over the streets. You'll have to keep an eye out for the vandals causing mayhem while corralling the Clockwork in the process."

